# Applies to client/Dockerfile.prod only (BuildKit reads <Dockerfile>.dockerignore in
# preference to a root .dockerignore). That build's context is the repo root, so send
# just the two folders it copies, minus what client/.dockerignore keeps out when the
# context is client/.
*
!client
!shared

**/node_modules
**/npm-debug.log
**/dist
**/.env
**/.env.local
**/.DS_Store
**/*.log
**/.vite
**/coverage
**/.git
**/.gitignore
**/README.md
